  (text "Encoder and two buttons, to the RP2350 on the Pi board over a 16-way 1.0 mm flat cable."
    (at 25.4 27.94 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "a8ada5e4-0e25-4d09-990c-d8181b271a39")
  )
  (text "Pins 12 and 13 are kept for the two button lights, 14 is spare. VDD is the RP2350's 3.3 V."
    (at 25.4 34.29 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e0246569-6d75-4fe7-a01f-2637a4060729")
  )
  (text "The encoder's lugs are not grounded: its bush is nutted to the case."
